<div class="founder">
  <div class="founder-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">Case Study</div>
    <h2 style="text-align:center">One Dealership Put It to the Test. Here's What Happened.</h2>
    <p class="founder-p">Kayalar Motors is an independent dealership in Houston. They know what it costs when a lead doesn't get called back, and what a slow follow-up looks like to a customer who already moved on. <strong>So before Nemroot went to any other dealership, it went to work on their lot first.</strong></p>
    <div class="founder-callout">The numbers below are from that lot over the last 30 days. <strong>Real dealership, real results, nothing simulated.</strong></div>
    <div>
      <button class="btn" type="button" data-scroll-to=".sbar">Check the Numbers</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .founder { background: var(--bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .founder-inner { max-width: 47rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px var(--pad); text-align: center; }
  .founder-p { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--muted-2); margin: 0 auto 20px; max-width: none; }
  .founder-p :global(strong) { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  .founder-callout {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 20px 32px;
    margin: 4px 0 28px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted-2);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 36rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .founder-callout :global(strong) { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
